{%- comment -%}
  C++ test of discriminator `d` against the labels of a union case: `d == 1 || d == 2`.
  Parameters: c (the case), t (the discriminator type), d (expression).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  for l in c.labels
    unless forloop.first
      echo ' || '
    endunless
    echo d | append: ' == '
    render '_value', v: l, t: t
  endfor
-%}
